egative (-5.0%), diluting holders.","The share count has grown 23.2% a year over five years, diluting existing holders.","It pays out 419% of earnings, more than it earns, so the dividend is at risk."],"people":["With about 29 employees, each generates about $6.7M of revenue, 2.9x the Real Estate median, and productivity has risen 26.5% a year.","That works out to $3.8M of free cash flow per employee.","CEO pay is $2.0M (0x revenue per employee).","Stock compensation averages $203K per employee."]},"profile":{"v":"AVOID","conv":48,"head":"Avoid: operating income covers interest only 1.1x.","pros":["Trades 59% below fair value of $46.33","FCF margin 56.1%","Revenue grew 26.5%/yr over 3y","Operating margin expanding 3.8%/yr"],"cons":["ROIC 1.3% vs WACC 6.9%","Net debt/EBITDA 7.6x","Interest coverage only 1.1x","Fair value is low-confidence (wide Monte Carlo spread)","P/E 89.5x vs sector 23.6x"],"flags":["Operating income covers interest only 1.1x"],"need":[],"buy_below":39.38,"vc":{"base":46.33,"base_src":"dcf","bear":23.3,"bull":88.62,"alt_median":10.21,"n_alt":2,"gap":5.5259,"dispersion":0.8641,"level":"LOW","why":["Monte Carlo spread is wide","models disagree (86% dispersion)","DCF is 553% above the other models' median ($10.21)","bull case is 3.8x the bear case"]},"med":{"pe":23.5593,"ev_ebitda":16.316,"pfcf":17.832,"pb":1.3568,"roic":0.0411,"gross_margin":0.5765,"fcf_margin":0.1733,"div_yield":0.0479}},"ticker":"NTST","date":"2026-11-06"}